Package: swift-touch-kde
Version: 0.1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: chaos <chaos@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: 131
Depends: init-system-helpers (>= 1.52), python3:any, python3-pyqt6, systemd, udev, xdg-utils
Recommends: plasma-workspace
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/chaos-teory/swift-touch-kde
Description: Acer Swift multimedia touchpad integration for KDE Plasma
 Swift Touch KDE provides media-strip support for Acer Swift touchpads on Linux.
 .
 The package installs a user service that maps touchpad multimedia strip actions
 to media keys, a tray controller, and a KDE System Settings entry.
